    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the Axis enum for 3D spatial directions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This enum represents the three principal axes in a 3D Cartesian coordinate system. It is used throughout the simulation for specifying directions or indexing coordinates. </para>
